utritional support for celiac disease and gluten-controlled diets. Through his work, Dr. García Almeida plays a vital role in advancing the understanding and management of dietary needs in patients with specific health conditions.", "M.ª CRISTINA PORCA FERNÁNDEZ:Dr. M.ª Cristina Porca Fernández is a medical professional specializing in dietary planning and nutritional surveys. She serves as a dietitian-nutritionist at the Complejo Hospitalario Universitario de Ferrol, located in A Coruña, Spain.", "ANA ZUGASTI MURILLO:Ana Zugasti Murillo is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently working in the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics section of the Complejo Hospitalario de Navarra. As a medical professional, she focuses on hospital diet planning, utilizing her expertise to develop effective dietary strategies for patients.", "ESTRELLA PETRINA JÁUREGUI:Dr. Estrella Petrina Jáuregui is a medical professional specializing in hospital diet planning. She serves as the head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics section at the Complejo Hospitalario de Navarra, where she plays a crucial role in overseeing dietary practices and nutritional care within the hospital setting.", "ÁNGEL REBOLLO ROM(\"ENTITY\":", "CÓRDOBA:", "SOCIEDADES AMERICANAS DE CARDIOLOGÍA:The American Heart Association provides dietary recommendations to reduce the risk of cardiovascular diseases.", "SOCIEDADES AMERICANAS DE DIABETES:The American Diabetes Association offers guidelines for dietary practices to manage and prevent diabetes.", "SOCIEDADES AMERICANAS DE ONCOLOGÍA:The American Society of Clinical Oncology develops dietary recommendations aimed at reducing cancer risk."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}